# Single-block I/O latency (microseconds) mmap vs io_uring, by percentile.
# SOURCE: docs/io_uring_migration/benchmark_results.md
#   "Phase 3: Head-to-Head Comparison" ->
#     "Block-Level Random Read (1024 blocks, summary report averages)" and
#     "Block-Level Random Write (1024 blocks, summary report averages)".
# Read  p50/p99: mmap ~32/~90 us, io_uring ~61/~210 us.
# Write p50/p99: mmap ~44/~120 us, io_uring ~74/~225 us.
# These are the ledger's "summary report averages" (recorded with ~). 256 KB
# blocks, Samsung 990 PRO NVMe, 2026-02-20. NO re-run, NO interpolation.
#
# metric_label      mmap_us  iouring_us
"Read p50"      32   61
"Read p99"      90   210
"Write p50"     44   74
"Write p99"     120  225
